OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA partly
OL,6,Fcloudy and pleasant evening for most,
OL,7,Falthough patches of low cloud may
OL,8,Fdevelop. Clouding over through the
OL,9,Fnight with light rain developing from
OL,10,Fthe west towards dawn. Very mild with
OL,11,Ffresh winds.
OL,12,
OL,13,CWednesday:FCloudy with patchy, mostly
OL,14,Flight, rain through the morning. The
OL,15,Frain clears to the east by mid-
OL,16,Fafternoon to leave a fine evening.
OL,17,FWarm in the sunshine and easing winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
